","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"},{"bioguideId":"L000590","fullName":"Rep. Lee, Susie [D-NV-3]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-02-13","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NV"},{"bioguideId":"N000191","fullName":"Rep. Neguse, Joe [D-CO-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-25","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CO"},{"bioguideId":"L000606","fullName":"Rep. Latimer, George [D-NY-16]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-03-26","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NY"},{"bioguideId":"M001234","fullName":"Rep. Morrison, Kelly [D-MN-3]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-05-07","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MN"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T21:09:03+00:00","id":"hr3110-119","introducedDate":"2025-04-30","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-04-30","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform."},"laws":[],"number":"3110","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Environmental Protection","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"L000599","district":17,"fullName":"Rep. Lawler, Michael [R-NY-17]","party":"R","state":"NY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-04-30","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>PFAS–Free Procurement Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits an executive agency from renewing or entering into a contract for the procurement of covered items that contain&nbsp;perfluorooctane sulfonate (PFOS) or perfluorooctanoic acid (PFOA). Under the bill, <em>covered items </em>means (1) nonstick cookware and cooking utensils; and (2) furniture, carpet, and any rug treated with stain-resistant coating.&nbsp;Both PFOS and PFOA are types of&nbsp;per- and&nbsp;polyfluoroalkyl substances, commonly known as PFAS. PFAS are man-made and may have adverse human health effects.</p><p>The bill also specifies that agencies must prioritize the procurement of covered items that do not contain&nbsp;PFAS.</p>","updateDate":"2025-08-04T19:35:17Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"PFAS–Free Procurement Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-17T23:48:39Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-17T23:48:39Z"}
